<!--
  Baseline rationale (audited 2026-05):

  - OldTargetApi: compileSdk is 37 but targetSdk stays at 36. Bumping it was
    tried and reverted: Robolectric's newest stable (4.16.1) caps at
    maxSdkVersion=36, so targetSdk 37 makes every Robolectric test fail with
    "Package targetSdkVersion=37 > maxSdkVersion=36", and the only available
    device (Z Fold 7) runs Android 16 — the Android 17 behavior changes the
    bump opts into cannot be observed on it. Revisit when Robolectric 4.17 is
    stable or an Android 17 device is on hand.

  - AcceptsUserCertificates: lint reports this from the debug overlay, where
    user CAs are intentionally trusted for mitmproxy/local-device testing.
    Release keeps system trust anchors only. Intentional; keep baselined.
-->
